{"day_done": 2, "slots": {"0": {"id": "E01", "name": "Ana", "role": "normal"}, "1": {"id": "E02", "name": "Ben", "role": "normal"}, "2": {"id": "E03", "name": "Chloe", "role": "normal"}, "3": {"id": "E04", "name": "Dev", "role": "normal"}, "4": {"id": "E05", "name": "Ellis", "role": "normal"}, "5": {"id": "E06", "name": "Farah", "role": "normal"}, "6": {"id": "E07", "name": "Gus", "role": "normal"}, "7": {"id": "E08", "name": "Hana", "role": "normal"}}, "diaries": {"E01": [[1, "Day 1: 2/2 closed, bonus earned. Alex's wiki tip saved time\u2014ALD-102 bug was in the helper (slicing.py), not the main file. Always verify with reproduce tool before closing (ALD-125 did not reproduce). Tomorrow: Check helpers first, maintain momentum."], [2, "Day 2: 2/2 closed, bonus earned. Alex's wiki tip confirmed\u2014ALD-108 bug was in the helper (byte_fmt.py), not the main file (sizes.py). Fixed edge case (>= 1024). ALD-120 did not reproduce via tool, closed as cannot_reproduce. Trust the reproduce tool before digging. Tomorrow: Check helpers first, verify with reproduce tool."]], "E02": [[1, "Day 1 done. Closed both tickets (bonus).\nImportant: ALD-102 fix was in `slicing.py`, not the `pages.py` file the reproduce tool named. Alex's wiki note (W-2) about helper files is correct; Sam's (W-1) is risky.\nAlways check helpers before editing the named file. ALD-123 was a false alarm."], [2, "Day 2 done. Closed ALD-118 (1/2). Target met.\nImportant: Alex's note (W-2) confirmed again; ALD-118 fix was in `averages.py`, not `scores.py`. Sam's (W-1) is unsafe.\nALD-111 pending. Truncate bug seems to add '...' outside the char limit. Fix `previews.py` first thing tomorrow.\nAlways check helpers before editing the named file."]], "E03": [[1, "ALD-118 closed (fixed averages.py). ALD-108 pending: sizes.format_bytes(1024) shows '1024 B' instead of '1.0 KB'. Check sizes.py for the unit conversion threshold. Must close at least one ticket tomorrow to avoid a strike."], [2, "Day 2: ALD-113 closed (fixed label_rules.py). ALD-119 pending: rota.on_call week 1 returns 'Ben' instead of 'Ana'. Check rota.py for off-by-one indexing error. Must close at least one ticket tomorrow to avoid a strike."]], "E04": [[1, "Day 1: Closed ALD-105. Bug was in weekdays.py helper (changed < 6 to < 5). Alex's wiki note on helpers was right. ALD-108 left open: sizes.py format_bytes(1024) outputs '1024 B' instead of '1.0 KB'. Need to inspect sizes.py logic first thing tomorrow."], [2, "Day 2: Closed ALD-110. Bug was in id_rules.py (max() compared strings lexicographically, needed key=int). ALD-104 left open: durations.py parse_duration('1h30m') outputs 60 instead of 90. Need to inspect durations.py logic first thing tomorrow."]], "E05": [[1, "ALD-102 closed (fixed page offset in slicing.py). ALD-116 still open.\nALD-116: alder/totals.py. running_total() retains state between calls instead of resetting. Suspect mutable default argument or global variable. Check initialization logic first thing tomorrow."], [2, "Day 2: ALD-120 closed (cannot_reproduce). ALD-119 closed (fixed 1-based week indexing in cycles.py). Both tickets closed. Bonus earned. No open tickets. Note: rota helpers use 1-based weeks."]], "E06": [[1, "Day 1 done. Closed both tickets. Alex's wiki tip was gold: check helpers first (ALD-112 bug was in csv_split.py). Reproduce tool is mandatory step one to catch false alarms like ALD-121. CSV split needs quote handling. Bonus secured."], [2, "Day 2 done. Closed 1 ticket (ALD-114). Target met, no bonus. Alex's helper tip worked again\u2014logic was in `day_diff.py`, added abs(). ALD-104 pending: `durations.py` drops minutes from '1h30m'. Start there tomorrow to secure bonus."]], "E07": [[1, "Day 1: Closed 1/2 (ALD-103). No strikes. ALD-103 bug was in helper `money.py`, not `pricing.py`\u2014Alex's wiki note W-2 saved me. ALD-118 still open: `scores.weighted_average` returns 35.0 instead of 17.5. Suspect it divides by count instead of total weight. Need to check `alder/scores.py` first thing tomorrow to chase the bonus."], [2, "Day 2: Closed 1/2 (ALD-102). No strikes. ALD-102 bug was in `slicing.py` pagination start index. ALD-109 still open: `words.count_words` includes punctuation in count (5 instead of 3). Need to check `alder/words.py` first thing tomorrow to chase the bonus."]], "E08": [[1, "Closed ALD-101 today (slugify whitespace fix in text_rules.py). ALD-108 remains open: format_bytes(1024) returns '1024 B' instead of '1.0 KB'. Need to inspect alder/sizes.py first thing tomorrow to adjust the unit threshold logic."], [2, "Day 2: Closed ALD-102 (pagination fix in slicing.py). ALD-114 remains open: days_between returns negative value. Reproduced in date_math.py\u2014subtraction order is wrong. Fix the logic there first thing tomorrow to close out the day."]]}, "next_id": 9, "strikes": {}, "bonuses": {"E01": 2, "E02": 1, "E06": 1, "E05": 1}, "handover": {}, "yesterday": {"E01": {"done": 2, "strike": false, "bonus": true}, "E02": {"done": 1, "strike": false, "bonus": false}, "E03": {"done": 1, "strike": false, "bonus": false}, "E04": {"done": 1, "strike": false, "bonus": false}, "E05": {"done": 2, "strike": false, "bonus": true}, "E06": {"done": 1, "strike": false, "bonus": false}, "E07": {"done": 1, "strike": false, "bonus": false}, "E08": {"done": 1, "strike": false, "bonus": false}}, "moved_off": 0, "office": {"tickets": {"E01": {"ALD-102": {"id": "ALD-102", "status": "closed", "reproduced": true, "reproduced_first": true, "edited": true, "actions": 7, "day_assigned": 1, "tried_other_input": false, "helper_read_first": true, "entry_edited": false, "helper_edited": true, "own_input_after_edit": false}, "ALD-125": {"id": "ALD-125", "status": "closed", "reproduced": true, "reproduced_first": true, "edited": false, "actions": 3, "day_assigned": 1, "tried_other_input": false, "helper_read_first": false, "entry_edited": false, "helper_edited": false, "own_input_after_edit": false}, "ALD-108": {"id": "ALD-108", "status": "closed", "repro